{"read_id": "READ-20261106-908632", "session_id": "SESSION-20261106-7332af", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-08dd5c"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "事故による予想外れと系統ずれの「当面仮定」を、未来へ渡す留保として解釈。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
