{"read_id": "READ-20261106-c44049", "session_id": "SESSION-20261106-7332af", "target": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261106-fcdfe6"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "境界を越える記録の読みをHershey–Chaseの標識分離で具体化。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
