{"read_id": "READ-20261106-4a9663", "session_id": "SESSION-20261106-7332af", "target": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261104-69f391"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "人間観・自己観の暫定回答を、痕跡・選別・留保の継承という観点から更新。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
